{"id":"3f0e497cfcdb9cb5","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-shore-nonembed.md","title":"P(ω)/fin 无法嵌入可数 c.e. 度结构","display":"thm-shore-nonembed — P(ω)/fin 无法嵌入可数 c.e. 度结构","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-shore-nonembed","aliases":["20-thm-shore-nonembed"],"display":"thm-shore-nonembed — P(ω)/fin 无法嵌入可数 c.e. 度结构","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.degree-structure","source_kind":"local-supplement","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"本地基数论证；原名称修正","depends_on":["[[20-df-mod-finite]]","[[20-df-redeg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-shore-nonembed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-shore-nonembed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-shore-nonembed — P(ω)/fin 无法嵌入可数 c.e. 度结构"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.degree-structure"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"本地基数论证；原名称修正"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68ee45ca9dee2182\" href=\"?note=68ee45ca9dee2182\" title=\"20-df-mod-finite\">20-df-mod-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=\\{[A]^*:A\\subseteq\\omega\\}\">\\(Q=\\{[A]^*:A\\subseteq\\omega\\}\\)</span>，顺序为模有限包含。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68ee45ca9dee2182\" href=\"?note=68ee45ca9dee2182\" title=\"20-df-mod-finite\">20-df-mod-finite</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 是 c.e. 度族，见上游 redeg；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{deg}\">\\(\\mathrm{deg}\\)</span> 只区分集合族和度族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shore\\text{-}nonembed}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists f:Q\\to\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n\\forall a,b\\in Q\\ [a\\le^*b\\Longleftrightarrow f(a)\\le f(b)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shore\\text{-}nonembed}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists f:Q\\to\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n\\forall a,b\\in Q\\ [a\\le^*b\\Longleftrightarrow f(a)\\le f(b)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保持并反映顺序的映射因反对称性必为单射。Q 有连续统多个类：不同无限二进制序列的有限前缀编码集合两两只有有限交集，故给出不同商类。c.e. 度只有可数多个，单射不可能。此基本基数论证不应无依据地冠名 Shore nonembedding。</p>\n<p>来源：本地基数论证；原名称修正。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-mod-finite","status":"resolved","id":"68ee45ca9dee2182","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mod-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mod-finite","status":"resolved","id":"68ee45ca9dee2182","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mod-finite]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mod-finite]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q=\\{[A]^*:A\\subseteq\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{deg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shore\\text{-}nonembed}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists f:Q\\to\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n\\forall a,b\\in Q\\ [a\\le^*b\\Longleftrightarrow f(a)\\le f(b)].","display":true}],"bytes":1376,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-486","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-shore-nonembed]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-486","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-shore-nonembed]]"}],"outgoing":["68ee45ca9dee2182","f389bdba28de0478"]}